WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:05.730
All right, I want to sort of get ahead of
this story and spend some time today talking

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:11.809
about supposed Biden mask mandates, because
the amount of disinformation that we're already

00:00:11.809 --> 00:00:16.940
seeing, if it's at all a preview, is going
to absolutely explode when Joe Biden is actually

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:20.700
sworn in as president of the United States
on January 20th.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:24.940
So to go back a little bit, right wingers
have been warning even during the campaign,

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.500
Joe Biden will lock everyone in their homes.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Joe Biden will be a dictator with masks and
all sorts of other things if he becomes president.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.390
And over the last 48 to 72 hours, we heard
two different things that are not the same

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:39.390
thing.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.480
Very important.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:47.329
We heard from Dr. Anthony Fauci that indeed,
Joe Biden plans to do a 100 day mask initiative.

00:00:47.329 --> 00:00:51.230
And within that, there will be a peace that
is a federal mask mandate.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
Now, when you hear a federal mask mandate,
many people imagine something that is very

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.980
different from what we're actually going to
get.

00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:05.120
So let me say this in the clearest terms possible,
Joe Biden nor any president can mandate a

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:11.430
national mask wearing a law where everybody's
forced to wear a mask outside of their homes.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.570
I've already addressed that.

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:16.130
So listen very closely to what I'm going to
say.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:22.840
What Joe Biden can do is address the nation
from the Oval Office and ask people to wear

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:23.840
masks.

00:01:23.840 --> 00:01:29.900
He can call the governors of 50 states and
ask them to put in place mask mandates, which

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.590
governors can do in various areas.

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:34.659
Massachusetts Governor Charlie Baker is an
example.

00:01:34.659 --> 00:01:39.310
Earlier this week, he's a Republican, announced
that there will be a massive mandate in workplaces

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:40.310
in Massachusetts.

00:01:40.310 --> 00:01:45.170
We got an email from our office tenant where
everybody's working from home anyway right

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:49.770
now, but they said everybody's got to wear
a mask per Charlie Bakers order.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:52.100
Governors can do that given states rights.

00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:57.200
And yet there's a ton of headlines today which
are very confusing in talking about a Joe

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:02.451
Biden nationwide mask mandate suggesting the
federal government will force everybody to

00:02:02.451 --> 00:02:03.451
wear a mask.

00:02:03.451 --> 00:02:04.910
So let me explain what's going on.

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:10.670
As the president of the United States, part
of the federal government, Joe Biden, plans

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:17.150
to issue a mask mandate that includes federal
buildings as well as airplanes, trains and

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.319
busses which are regulated by the federal
Department of Transportation.

00:02:21.319 --> 00:02:23.050
That's it.

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:27.459
That's the mandate, that's what the president
can do via executive order, and in just about

00:02:27.459 --> 00:02:31.060
every state, masks are already required in
all of those places.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:35.520
Now, I do have some federal government employee
friends who work in red states who have told

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:40.790
me, you know, the the equivalent agency in
Massachusetts and in California, you've got

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:44.120
to wear a mask in my office for that same
agency in a red state.

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:49.709
Our boss is not mandated masks that will change
based on this mask mandate for federal buildings,

00:02:49.709 --> 00:02:51.459
but it will change very little else.

00:02:51.459 --> 00:02:57.660
So before we go crazy misstating what this
is, Joe Biden's mandate will apply only to

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:02.560
federal buildings and transportation vehicles
regulated by the DOT.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:06.350
Beyond that, any mass guidelines from Biden
will merely be guidelines.

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.350
They will be requests.

00:03:07.350 --> 00:03:09.349
They will be proposals.

00:03:09.349 --> 00:03:11.980
It will be up to your governor to decide what
to do.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:12.980
That's it.

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:17.550
Now, Dr. Foushee has said wearing masks for
100 days is a good idea.

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:21.130
It will be up to the people and governors
ultimately to decide what it is they want

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.130
to do.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:25.989
For people who have been wearing masks for
months already, this is going to be much ado

00:03:25.989 --> 00:03:27.040
about nothing.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:30.209
Consider that, you know, there is now a light
at the end of the tunnel.

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:32.930
Let's actually work together to start getting
past this.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:34.010
If we can start.

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.599
Here's my trajectory.

00:03:35.599 --> 00:03:40.739
If we can start vaccinating five to seven
percent of our population each month, maybe

00:03:40.739 --> 00:03:42.349
that includes December.

00:03:42.349 --> 00:03:45.860
Maybe we only get, you know, one, two percent
done in December.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:49.510
In January, we get five to seven percent February,
etc..

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:54.080
This means in six months we could have somewhere
between 30 and 40, two percent of the population

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:58.170
vaccinated, plus the five to 10 percent who
will have recovered from the virus.

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:03.470
We don't yet know how uniform immunity is
when you recover.

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:08.440
There's the idea that if you have a very light
case, your immunity may not be as robust as

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:10.110
if you recover from a more serious case.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:15.040
So we don't know exactly, but we could be
heading towards roughly 50 percent level of

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:18.109
immunity by May 1st, maybe by May 15th.

00:04:18.109 --> 00:04:21.579
That won't be the end, but it will be a dramatically
better situation.

00:04:21.579 --> 00:04:25.900
We will also likely at that point have cheap
at home tests.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:31.199
So like for me, if I imagine, hey, I might
be able to order 50 or 100 of these cheap

00:04:31.199 --> 00:04:33.550
at home rapid tests.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:37.389
I've been very cautious, but I've continued
going to the grocery store.

00:04:37.389 --> 00:04:39.720
I go to the post office during the summer.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:44.250
I was hanging out outdoors with friends, eating
outdoors at restaurants.

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:50.189
If we had on May 15th, May 1st, May 15th,
50 percent immunity and these at home tests,

00:04:50.189 --> 00:04:54.550
I would likely be ready to say, for example,
hey, here's a group of six friends we've all

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:56.300
been working from home.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:05:01.240
If we all do a rapid test, I would be comfortable
if we're all negative, hanging out indoors,

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:05.550
maintaining a reasonable amount of distance,
assuming we're at 50 percent immunity with

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:06.550
these tests.

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:12.050
OK, I mean, listen, it's not perfect, but
we're talking about May, June.

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:16.099
And to be clear, with half the country vaccinated
now, you also have to remember there is a

00:05:16.099 --> 00:05:18.969
lag time on vaccination immunity.

00:05:18.969 --> 00:05:23.550
And what I mean by that is the time until
vaccinated people actually reduce the number

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:26.129
of deaths could is weeks.

00:05:26.129 --> 00:05:29.659
And what I mean by that is on day one, you
get dose number one dose.

00:05:29.659 --> 00:05:32.590
No one confers some immunity, but not all.

00:05:32.590 --> 00:05:34.960
So that starts to have an effect day.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:41.210
Twenty to twenty one days later, you get your
second dose and then seven days after that,

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:44.819
you would be considered to be, you know, there's
a ninety five percent chance that you were

00:05:44.819 --> 00:05:45.819
immune.

00:05:45.819 --> 00:05:54.349
So by day twenty eight to twenty nine, you
ideally are no longer getting other people

00:05:54.349 --> 00:06:00.929
sick who you might have gotten sick were you
not vaccinated since it takes 20 days in general

00:06:00.929 --> 00:06:07.440
from when someone catches the virus to when
they die, if they're going to die vaccinated,

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:13.879
individuals will not be fully effective at
reducing deaths for forty eight days.

00:06:13.879 --> 00:06:19.679
We won't see the impact on deaths of a vaccinated
individual for up to forty eight days.

00:06:19.679 --> 00:06:25.569
Now we know that after dose one you can be
as much as 70 or even 75 percent likely to

00:06:25.569 --> 00:06:26.569
be immune.

00:06:26.569 --> 00:06:28.499
So these are all confidence intervals.

00:06:28.499 --> 00:06:35.909
But I think you understand the point that
there's a lag time before which vaccination

00:06:35.909 --> 00:06:39.779
is not really doing doing that much to stop
cases and to stop deaths.

00:06:39.779 --> 00:06:42.110
So the point is this is a process.

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:48.720
And there is every indication that by May
one, May 15, we will be in a better situation.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:52.809
Masks will likely be required in just as many
places as they are today.

00:06:52.809 --> 00:06:53.809
But we are now.

00:06:53.809 --> 00:06:58.059
We had twenty nine hundred sixty people die
yesterday, were essentially at a 9/11 every

00:06:58.059 --> 00:06:59.059
day.

00:06:59.059 --> 00:07:04.259
So rather than the point is, rather than lying
about what Joe Biden plans to do, let's work

00:07:04.259 --> 00:07:04.860
together and start getting past this.

